# Packages (must)

Use **existing** stack first. Do not add libraries without a clear gap.

## Runtime (approved) - landing

| Package | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| `next` (App Router) | Routes, images, metadata |
| `react` / `react-dom` 19 | UI |
| `tailwindcss` v4 | Styling (`globals.css`, utilities) |
| `motion` | Section/card enter, stagger, hover lift |
| `lucide-react` | UI icons |
| `swiper` | Carousels / slides |
| `gsap` + `@gsap/react` | Complex timelines only |
| `react-hook-form` | Forms |
| `@/components/ui/*` | ButtonLink, IconBadge, SocialIcons, ScrollToTop, etc. |

## Optional later (admin / CMS - do not install until needed)

| Package | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| `@tanstack/react-query` | Public/admin CMS content fetch |
| `cloudinary` | Admin image/video uploads |
| `mongoose` | Admin CMS Mongo models |
| `jsonwebtoken` + `bcryptjs` | Admin JWT cookie auth |
| `sonner` | Admin panel toasts |

## Dev / QA

| Package | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| `typescript` | Types |
| `eslint` + `eslint-config-next` | Lint |
| `@playwright/test` | E2E (optional; `e2e/` ready) |
| `babel-plugin-react-compiler` | When `reactCompiler: true` in next.config |

## Rules

1. Prefer Motion over GSAP for simple UI motion
2. Prefer Lucide over new icon packs
3. Prefer Swiper over custom drag carousels
4. Before `npm install <pkg>`: confirm no existing primitive covers it; ask user if adding a dependency
5. Do not add UI kits (MUI, Chakra, shadcn dump) unless the user explicitly requests
6. Keep versions aligned with `package.json`; do not downgrade Next/React casually

## Never

- Install unused packages
- Duplicate Motion + GSAP on the same element
- CDN scripts for libs already in `package.json`
